  "post_content": "<p class=\"Poromisin\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.65pt;line-height:120%;tab-stops:36.0pt 72.0pt 108.0pt 144.0pt 180.0pt 216.0pt 252.0pt 288.0pt 324.0pt 360.0pt 396.0pt 432.0pt 468.0pt\"><span lang=\"ES-TRAD\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">(32 fotos) M&aacute;s de 350 combinados se han servido en el primer fin de semana de la Ruta del C&oacute;ctel Onda. Los locales participantes destacan la gran aceptaci&oacute;n de las propuestas y la satisfacci&oacute;n de los clientes con ellas, seg&uacute;n una nota de la Asociaci&oacute;n de Hosteler&iacute;a y Turismo (Hosturionda).</span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inicirutacoctel/rutacoctel1.jpg\" alt=\"rutacoctel1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inicirutacoctel/rutacoctel10.jpg\" alt=\"rutacoctel10\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inicirutacoctel/rutacoctel11.jpg\" alt=\"rutacoctel11\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inicirutacoctel/rutacoctel12.jpg\" alt=\"rutacoctel12\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inicirutacoctel/rutacoctel13.jpg\" alt=\"rutacoctel13\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inicirutacoctel/rutacoctel14.jpg\" alt=\"rutacoctel14\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inicirutacoctel/rutacoctel15.jpg\" alt=\"rutacoctel15\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><